[{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_03b36459a5059629016a9b61b51e1887d0a08d3f5f8d00f79f","seq":11143,"timestamp":"1788568017Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"打包前修正一个审计发现：若 tunnel 允许任意本地端口，Host 返回的 `hcpWebSocketUrl` 仍指向远端固定 18092，浏览器不会自动知道 28092 映射，之前的“双转发”测试只证明 SSH 命令存在，没有证明 locator 可用。最小正确合同是 Stage 4 的 SSH tunnel 在客户端也固定占用 18091/18092；若端口冲突应结构化失败，而不是生成不可用 locator。先收紧 CLI/installer，再打包。","startedSeq":11023,"endedSeq":11143,"startedAt":"1788568017Z","endedAt":"1788568018Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":8258,"revision":11143,"observedAt":"1788568018Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788568018Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788568018,"revision":11143,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_03b36459a5059629016a9b61b51e1887d0a08d3f5f8d00f79f","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-11144","seq":11144,"timestamp":"1788568018Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":11144,"endedSeq":11270,"startedAt":"1788568018Z","endedAt":"1788568183Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":11144,"activityEndSeq":11270,"totalEventCount":19,"toolCallCount":16,"thoughtCount":3,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":2,"writtenFileCount":5,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_063b36ccb10f98b2016a9b6272b60c87d0b6e70b7422c3dbd7","seq":11391,"timestamp":"1788568183Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"打包产物检查发现启动脚本替换没有生效：Gradle 8.14 模板在 Windows 使用 `JAVA_EXE`、POSIX 使用一整段 `JAVA_HOME` 探测，而不是预期的 `JAVACMD=java`。当前 bundle 虽包含 runtime，但仍会错误依赖系统 Java，尚不满足退出条件。我会改为对生成脚本做带失败断言的精确模板替换；若上游模板变化导致替换缺失，构建直接失败，不能静默产出错误 bundle。","startedSeq":11271,"endedSeq":11391,"startedAt":"1788568183Z","endedAt":"1788568184Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":8424,"revision":11391,"observedAt":"1788568184Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788568184Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788568184,"revision":11391,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_063b36ccb10f98b2016a9b6272b60c87d0b6e70b7422c3dbd7","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-11392","seq":11392,"timestamp":"1788568185Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":11392,"endedSeq":11453,"startedAt":"1788568185Z","endedAt":"1788568290Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":11392,"activityEndSeq":11453,"totalEventCount":11,"toolCallCount":9,"thoughtCount":2,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":3,"writtenFileCount":1,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0d5ca98ef6c4767f016a9b62d752c087d0883d984c730dd93d","seq":11603,"timestamp":"1788568290Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"零系统 Java 启动验证成功到达 `JiStandalone.main` 并按预期因目标健康端口不存在而退出，证明脚本实际使用 bundle 内 Java；Node 也不在该测试 PATH。接下来处理远程可用性的下一处真实缺口：远程服务启动后，客户端没有获得一次性 launch/pairing token，SSH tunnel 虽建立也无法认证。Stage 4 只实现单设备的 SSH-assisted Host 配对与可撤销本地凭据，不进入 Stage 5 的 Relay、多 Client、角色提升或 E2EE。先核对已批准的 Host/device 信任合同，再定义最小 durable registry 和 SSH 取回一次性 pairing material。","startedSeq":11454,"endedSeq":11603,"startedAt":"1788568290Z","endedAt":"1788568291Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":8531,"revision":11603,"observedAt":"1788568291Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788568291Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788568291,"revision":11603,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0d5ca98ef6c4767f016a9b62d752c087d0883d984c730dd93d","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-11605","seq":11605,"timestamp":"1788568297Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":11605,"endedSeq":11626,"startedAt":"1788568297Z","endedAt":"1788568320Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":11605,"activityEndSeq":11626,"totalEventCount":5,"toolCallCount":4,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":1,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0dd5bc118b5f4907016a9b62ebca3887d0b3aa66f817648a0a","seq":11895,"timestamp":"1788568320Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"配对合同核对后需要避免范围漂移：Stage 4 要求 SSH 安装后的 Host/device pairing，但 Stage 5 才实现 Relay、多 Client 平权、角色提升和 E2EE。最小 Stage 4 方案应是 **Host 本地持久化的单设备会话凭据**：\n\n- 一次性 token 仍只经 SSH/loopback 取得并交换，不成为长期 bearer；\n- Host 只持久化随机 session token 的摘要和设备 ID，不保存明文；\n- cookie 在 Host 重启后仍有效，支持设备列出/吊销；\n- 不实现 Relay invitation、跨设备同步、角色模型或 E2EE。\n\n现有 `LocalTokenService` 仅内存保存 token/cookie，Host 重启后 cookie 失效，且独立 SSH installer 无法向正在运行的 Host 发 token。修复将把 token 摘要与设备 session 摘要原子存入 `JI_DATA_DIR` 下 `0600` 文件，并提供仅本机进程可调用的一次性 token issuance CLI；远程 bootstrap 只在用户请求 launch 时经 SSH 取得 token，不记录、不写 manifest。先读取安全/状态规则中对应的持久化和 secret 约束，再实现。","startedSeq":11627,"endedSeq":11895,"startedAt":"1788568320Z","endedAt":"1788568333Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":8573,"revision":11895,"observedAt":"1788568333Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788568333Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788568333,"revision":11895,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0dd5bc118b5f4907016a9b62ebca3887d0b3aa66f817648a0a","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-11896","seq":11896,"timestamp":"1788568333Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":11896,"endedSeq":11916,"startedAt":"1788568333Z","endedAt":"1788568351Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":11896,"activityEndSeq":11916,"totalEventCount":5,"toolCallCount":4,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":3,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_040be241fe85dfa7016a9b6311541887d0baec32f4f36b58f3","seq":12187,"timestamp":"1788568351Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"安全合同排除了刚才考虑的“持久 cookie 摘要充当设备身份”方案：设计明确要求本地 cookie 短期、Remote 每设备独立身份，而完整 challenge-response/Noise 属于 Stage 5。不能为满足 Stage 4 的 SSH pairing 文案提前造一个长期 bearer 兼容层。\n\nStage 4 的最小边界因此保持为 SSH 管理信道辅助的本地 launch：安装/启动/隧道完成后，通过不落盘的 SSH 控制通道向**正在运行的 Host 进程**请求一次性 token，浏览器交换成短期 cookie。该 IPC 必须是进程内本地管理通道，不能由第二个进程自行签 token，也不能出现在 systemd 日志、参数或环境。这个跨进程通道与实际 Ubuntu 验证需要一起实现；在此之前不把现有 tunnel 标为“已配对”。\n\n我先完成与此独立、且同样阻断 Stage 4 的 Web/REST 明确缺口：安全搜索高亮、Diff、队列重排、Provider Profile durable 管理和 PWA 非敏感缓存；之后再回到 SSH IPC，以免把认证边界与 UI 状态混在一次改动中。","startedSeq":11917,"endedSeq":12187,"startedAt":"1788568351Z","endedAt":"1788568356Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":8596,"revision":12187,"observedAt":"1788568356Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788568356Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788568356,"revision":12187,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_040be241fe85dfa7016a9b6311541887d0baec32f4f36b58f3","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-12188","seq":12188,"timestamp":"1788568361Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":12188,"endedSeq":12214,"startedAt":"1788568361Z","endedAt":"1788568369Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":12188,"activityEndSeq":12214,"totalEventCount":7,"toolCallCount":6,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":3,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0c93a659d7586541016a9b632d33d487d0ac29d5bb749ca97e","seq":12310,"timestamp":"1788568370Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"范围收敛如下：Provider Profile 的领域类型已存在于 `ji-ai-api`，因此不新造第二个 profile model；Host 只需增加持久化 store/REST 管理投影并让 composer 引用稳定 profile ID。Diff 也不引入新 canonical 状态，直接从已有 Tool event/result 的结构化内容投影。先做无争议的安全 UI 修复和队列重排，再接 Provider Profile。","startedSeq":12215,"endedSeq":12310,"startedAt":"1788568370Z","endedAt":"1788568371Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":8611,"revision":12310,"observedAt":"1788568371Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788568371Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788568371,"revision":12310,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0c93a659d7586541016a9b632d33d487d0ac29d5bb749ca97e","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-12312","seq":12312,"timestamp":"1788568377Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":12312,"endedSeq":12544,"startedAt":"1788568377Z","endedAt":"1788568680Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":12312,"activityEndSeq":12544,"totalEventCount":43,"toolCallCount":35,"thoughtCount":8,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":9,"writtenFileCount":4,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_00f3feb2cfa2ccd1016a9b6463440887d0ad673439e6588b5c","seq":12638,"timestamp":"1788568680Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"失败定位到 durable 恢复投影：Tool 卡片能由 assistant tool call + tool result 重建，但 `restoredTools` 丢弃了 assistant tool call 的 arguments，因此 Diff 无法取得 path/edits。根因不是 Diff 组件，而是刷新后 Tool 投影不完整；修复为按 `toolCallId` 同时恢复 name 和 arguments，这也直接改善浏览器/Host 重启后的 Tool 展示一致性。","startedSeq":12545,"endedSeq":12638,"startedAt":"1788568680Z","endedAt":"1788568681Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":8921,"revision":12638,"observedAt":"1788568681Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788568681Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788568681,"revision":12638,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_00f3feb2cfa2ccd1016a9b6463440887d0ad673439e6588b5c","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-12640","seq":12640,"timestamp":"1788568681Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":12640,"endedSeq":12659,"startedAt":"1788568681Z","endedAt":"1788568714Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":12640,"activityEndSeq":12659,"totalEventCount":3,"toolCallCount":2,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":1,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_06e5d539785575f8016a9b647de0bc87d0b375a1170407da82","seq":12793,"timestamp":"1788568714Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"刷新后的 Tool/ Diff 投影已修复并通过 7 个前端测试。现在处理 Provider Profile 时必须先守住事实源：仅做“可编辑表单但运行时仍使用启动环境配置”会制造第二事实源，不能接受。我会检查 Agent runtime 是否已支持按 `ModelRef.provider` 路由多个 Provider；若不支持，Stage 4 的最小正确实现是 Host-owned Profile registry + 一个动态 provider router，使保存后的 Profile 能在下一 Run 生效，同时当前 Run 保持已捕获配置。凭据仍只保存引用和配置状态，绝不经 REST 返回明文。","startedSeq":12660,"endedSeq":12793,"startedAt":"1788568714Z","endedAt":"1788568716Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":8956,"revision":12793,"observedAt":"1788568716Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788568716Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788568716,"revision":12793,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_06e5d539785575f8016a9b647de0bc87d0b375a1170407da82","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-12794","seq":12794,"timestamp":"1788568722Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":12794,"endedSeq":12857,"startedAt":"1788568722Z","endedAt":"1788568802Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":12794,"activityEndSeq":12857,"totalEventCount":12,"toolCallCount":10,"thoughtCount":2,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":7,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0747d1ed665fbbf1016a9b64ac6ffc87d09748aeaae5b3e0be","seq":13074,"timestamp":"1788568802Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"Provider runtime核对揭示一个必须先处理的设计边界：Core 目前只有单个 `ModelProvider`，而 active Run snapshot 只捕获 profile ID/model/reasoning，没有捕获 Profile revision。直接加 Profile CRUD 会让当前 Run 在同一 ID 更新后中途切 endpoint，违反“Run 启动时快照”语义；只做表单则成为假 UI。该项不能用局部补丁完成，我会在 Host Profile registry 中把 `(profileId, profileRevision)` 纳入 Run configuration，并由 revision-aware provider router 保留活动 revision，之后再开放 UI。先不提交半成品 Profile CRUD。\n\n当前先完成独立的 PWA 安全缓存和 installability：网络优先缓存静态壳与非敏感 Host locator；不缓存 Session summary（现有摘要含 working directory，不能冒充非敏感）、snapshot、timeline、search、artifact 或命令；增加 manifest icon 和离线 fallback，并用 service-worker 源码合同测试固定 allowlist。","startedSeq":12858,"endedSeq":13074,"startedAt":"1788568802Z","endedAt":"1788568806Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":9046,"revision":13074,"observedAt":"1788568806Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788568806Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788568806,"revision":13074,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0747d1ed665fbbf1016a9b64ac6ffc87d09748aeaae5b3e0be","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-13075","seq":13075,"timestamp":"1788568806Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":13075,"endedSeq":13112,"startedAt":"1788568806Z","endedAt":"1788568870Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":13075,"activityEndSeq":13112,"totalEventCount":6,"toolCallCount":5,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":4,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_09b49146eae33f53016a9b6520add487d0a6258121803bda4b","seq":13162,"timestamp":"1788568870Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"PWA 测试失败是断言把标准 `URL.search` 属性误判为 `/api/v1/search` 资源，不是缓存越界。将断言改为完整 API 路径，保留 allowlist 语义。","startedSeq":13113,"endedSeq":13162,"startedAt":"1788568870Z","endedAt":"1788568871Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":9111,"revision":13162,"observedAt":"1788568871Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788568871Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788568871,"revision":13162,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_09b49146eae33f53016a9b6520add487d0a6258121803bda4b","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-13163","seq":13163,"timestamp":"1788568871Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":13163,"endedSeq":13239,"startedAt":"1788568871Z","endedAt":"1788569001Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":13163,"activityEndSeq":13239,"totalEventCount":13,"toolCallCount":10,"thoughtCount":3,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":3,"writtenFileCount":1,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0c58ea42a87d8fd2016a9b659ed2e487d0a9abcc4900b49666","seq":13370,"timestamp":"1788569001Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"Profile revision 需要贯穿三个已有边界：`ComposerConfig`（选择事实）、`SessionRunConfigurationSource`（Run 快照）和 provider router（执行路由）。为避免把内部 revision 塞进 Provider `options` 并泄漏到外部请求，我会扩展 `RunConfiguration` 为显式 `profileRevision` 字段；这属于公开孵化 API，随后同步 API baseline。Profile registry 自身落在 Host 应用层，SQLite adapter 原子持久化非 secret 配置，credential 仍由现有 credential store 管理。先固定类型和红色测试，再接实现。","startedSeq":13240,"endedSeq":13370,"startedAt":"1788569001Z","endedAt":"1788569003Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":9243,"revision":13370,"observedAt":"1788569003Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788569003Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788569003,"revision":13370,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0c58ea42a87d8fd2016a9b659ed2e487d0a9abcc4900b49666","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-13373","seq":13373,"timestamp":"1788569008Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":13373,"endedSeq":13564,"startedAt":"1788569008Z","endedAt":"1788569226Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":13373,"activityEndSeq":13564,"totalEventCount":28,"toolCallCount":25,"thoughtCount":3,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":4,"writtenFileCount":4,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0706d86a21cf8a28016a9b66747d9887d098c3ec831bef4acc","seq":13760,"timestamp":"1788569226Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"Profile revision 合同已在 Session/Composer 持久化层编译通过。为避免一次性改动过大，我会用现有 API 的最小扩展完成执行路由：\n\n1. `ModelRequest` 增加显式 `profileRevision`，保留旧构造器使所有既有 adapter 调用不必兼容分支；\n2. Host 在 Run 接受前把 Session composer 中的 profile revision 刷新为 registry 当前 revision，并在 Run 启动时捕获；\n3. revision-aware router 按 `(profileId, revision)` 选择 immutable provider 实例，旧 revision 在活动 Run 结束前保留；\n4. Profile 保存用 CAS；删除被 Session/active Run 引用的 revision 时拒绝，不做 fallback。\n\n现在先读取 prompt 接受顺序，确保“刷新 profile revision”和“捕获 Run config”处于同一 Host 写边界，而不是先写一半。","startedSeq":13565,"endedSeq":13760,"startedAt":"1788569226Z","endedAt":"1788569230Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":9470,"revision":13760,"observedAt":"1788569230Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788569230Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788569230,"revision":13760,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0706d86a21cf8a28016a9b66747d9887d098c3ec831bef4acc","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-13763","seq":13763,"timestamp":"1788569233Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":13763,"endedSeq":13780,"startedAt":"1788569233Z","endedAt":"1788569260Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":13763,"activityEndSeq":13780,"totalEventCount":4,"toolCallCount":3,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":2,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0c10a140f0eea5d5016a9b669544b087d08f644229407ab782","seq":13877,"timestamp":"1788569260Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"先把执行路由所需的不可变身份落实到 `ModelRequest`，再接 registry；这是最小可编译步。既有调用方仍可用旧构造器并默认为 revision 0，Host-captured Run 显式传入 revision。该兼容构造器只是 Java 源码调用便利，不是旧产品路径或运行时 fallback；执行时 router 仍严格按 `(profileId, profileRevision)` 查找。","startedSeq":13781,"endedSeq":13877,"startedAt":"1788569260Z","endedAt":"1788569262Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":9502,"revision":13877,"observedAt":"1788569262Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788569262Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788569262,"revision":13877,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0c10a140f0eea5d5016a9b669544b087d08f644229407ab782","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-13878","seq":13878,"timestamp":"1788569262Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":13878,"endedSeq":13905,"startedAt":"1788569262Z","endedAt":"1788569316Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":13878,"activityEndSeq":13905,"totalEventCount":4,"toolCallCount":3,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":2,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_063d0d4fd99e39f3016a9b66d7e41c87d095978baaa881383a","seq":14083,"timestamp":"1788569316Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"`ModelRequest.profileRevision` 已加入且 AI/Core 全回归通过。Profile registry 不能直接持久化现有 `ProviderProfile`，因为它包含短生命周期 `SensitiveHeader` 值；正确数据结构必须将 durable authoring definition 与 executable snapshot 分开：\n\n- durable definition：id/family/baseUrl/credential reference/header credential references/model catalog/settings/revision；\n- executable snapshot：按具体 revision 解析 credential/header secret 后构造现有 `ProviderProfile`，只活在 provider 实例生命周期内；\n- REST 只返回 definition 和 credential 配置状态，不返回 secret；\n- router 按 request 的 `(profileId, profileRevision)` 选择实例。\n\n这复用已有 `ProviderProfile` 作为执行合同，不改 adapter 语义。接下来核对现有自定义 Header 解析方式，避免重复凭据实现。","startedSeq":13906,"endedSeq":14083,"startedAt":"1788569316Z","endedAt":"1788569318Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":9558,"revision":14083,"observedAt":"1788569318Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788569318Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788569318,"revision":14083,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_063d0d4fd99e39f3016a9b66d7e41c87d095978baaa881383a","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-14085","seq":14085,"timestamp":"1788569323Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":14085,"endedSeq":14104,"startedAt":"1788569323Z","endedAt":"1788569339Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":14085,"activityEndSeq":14104,"totalEventCount":5,"toolCallCount":4,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":3,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_036c3512209608a5016a9b66ef5db487d08db5f59c7349b414","seq":14205,"timestamp":"1788569339Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"自定义 Header 现有 adapter 把 `SensitiveHeader` 作为 provider 实例生命周期资源，因此 registry 不能自己解析并长期缓存明文。可执行快照创建时由 credential service 为每个 header reference 解析 `SensitiveValue`，provider revision retired 后立即关闭并清零；REST definition 始终只有 reference。为控制范围，先实现 registry + revision router 的纯领域/产品合同，再把 SQLite/REST/UI 接入；每一步都跑对应测试。","startedSeq":14105,"endedSeq":14205,"startedAt":"1788569339Z","endedAt":"1788569341Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":9581,"revision":14205,"observedAt":"1788569341Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788569341Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788569341,"revision":14205,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_036c3512209608a5016a9b66ef5db487d08db5f59c7349b414","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-14206","seq":14206,"timestamp":"1788569345Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":14206,"endedSeq":14231,"startedAt":"1788569345Z","endedAt":"1788569376Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":14206,"activityEndSeq":14231,"totalEventCount":5,"toolCallCount":4,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":3,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_08cca272a5ff4785016a9b670583b887d09322b242ea27d524","seq":14373,"timestamp":"1788569376Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"Profile registry 的实体与生命周期确定如下：`ProviderProfileDefinition` 是 Host durable authoring fact；`ProviderProfile` 是按 revision 构造的执行快照；`ModelRequest.profileRevision` 选择执行快照。SQLite Profile store 与 Session aggregate 同属 Host 数据目录但各自事务，Profile CAS 不与 Session 写混为伪原子事务；Session 只持久化 `(profileId, profileRevision)` 引用。Profile 更新不会扫描或重写所有 Session，下一 Run 启动时在该 Session 锁内刷新引用并产生一条 durable composer event。这样 I/O 与状态增长均有界，避免 N+1 和全量迁移。","startedSeq":14232,"endedSeq":14373,"startedAt":"1788569376Z","endedAt":"1788569380Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":9620,"revision":14373,"observedAt":"1788569380Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788569380Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788569380,"revision":14373,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_08cca272a5ff4785016a9b670583b887d09322b242ea27d524","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-14374","seq":14374,"timestamp":"1788569380Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":14374,"endedSeq":14431,"startedAt":"1788569380Z","endedAt":"1788569533Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":14374,"activityEndSeq":14431,"totalEventCount":8,"toolCallCount":7,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":5,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0b0952cfaa6d6ff8016a9b67a7811087d09c81a53e1311122e","seq":14607,"timestamp":"1788569533Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"Profile registry/router 的内存合同已通过。接下来把它接到持久产品路径，范围保持最小：\n\n- 新增 `SqliteProviderProfileStore`，只存非 secret definition 的所有 revision，以 `MAX(revision)` 作为 current 并在事务中 CAS；\n- `ProviderProfileApplicationService` 统一验证 model 属于当前 catalog，并在 Run 真正启动前刷新 Session composer 的 profile revision；\n- `PromptApplicationService` 增加可注入的 start hook，默认无操作仅供不使用 Profile registry 的嵌入测试；产品 composition 必须注入 registry；\n- REST/HCP composer 都走同一 Profile service，避免旁路。\n\n不开放 Profile 删除，直到能证明所有 Session/active Run 引用已解除；这比实现会破坏 revision pin 的删除接口更符合当前合同。","startedSeq":14432,"endedSeq":14607,"startedAt":"1788569533Z","endedAt":"1788569535Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":9775,"revision":14607,"observedAt":"1788569535Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788569535Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788569535,"revision":14607,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0b0952cfaa6d6ff8016a9b67a7811087d09c81a53e1311122e","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-14608","seq":14608,"timestamp":"1788569536Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":14608,"endedSeq":14723,"startedAt":"1788569536Z","endedAt":"1788569720Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":14608,"activityEndSeq":14723,"totalEventCount":15,"toolCallCount":13,"thoughtCount":2,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":1,"writtenFileCount":6,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_09dfbb4336fac2ba016a9b686ed4c887d0bba5a8015caf529e","seq":14810,"timestamp":"1788569721Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"Host/SQLite 生命周期编译和既有 TCK 已通过。现在实现 SQLite Profile revision store，并用同一数据库的并发实例测试 CAS：一个实例成功写 revision 1 后，另一个基于旧 revision 的写必须失败且不能覆盖；重启后 revision 0/1 都可按明确 identity 读取。这固定 side-by-side active Run 所需的旧 revision 保留语义。","startedSeq":14724,"endedSeq":14810,"startedAt":"1788569721Z","endedAt":"1788569728Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":9968,"revision":14810,"observedAt":"1788569728Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788569728Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788569728,"revision":14810,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_09dfbb4336fac2ba016a9b686ed4c887d0bba5a8015caf529e","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-14811","seq":14811,"timestamp":"1788569729Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":14811,"endedSeq":14869,"startedAt":"1788569729Z","endedAt":"1788569882Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":14811,"activityEndSeq":14869,"totalEventCount":10,"toolCallCount":8,"thoughtCount":2,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":2,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0eb61d436df15183016a9b6909abd887d0b3b13743e4cf93a5","seq":14948,"timestamp":"1788569882Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"SQLite Profile 历史已通过 restart/concurrent CAS 测试。现在接 composition 时遵循关闭顺序：router 先关闭所有 provider revision（清零 header secret），再关闭 credential service，最后关闭 Profile store；反向会让活动 provider 在关闭期间引用已失效 secret。测试注入 faux provider 仍走同一 revision identity，但不访问真实 credential。","startedSeq":14870,"endedSeq":14948,"startedAt":"1788569882Z","endedAt":"1788569884Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":10124,"revision":1